WEBVTT

00:13:00.076 --> 00:13:03.846
And when I reflect on that,
I think to myself:

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:05.281
When did we learn

00:13:06.416 --> 00:13:09.385
to shout our anger
and to whisper our kindness?

00:13:09.419 --> 00:13:10.953
It's completely upside down.

00:13:12.488 --> 00:13:17.093
I don't know if that's
the reality TV culture we live in or what,

00:13:17.126 --> 00:13:18.928
but it's totally backwards.

00:13:19.662 --> 00:13:25.101
It's time we learned again
to shout kindness, to shout compassion,

00:13:25.134 --> 00:13:27.337
to shout justice.

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:33.276
That's the purpose of American democracy
and the source of our greatness.